["dodge", "birds", "angry", "fly", "horizon"], "long_description": "Take Flight and Dodge the Flock in the Ultimate VR Reflex Challenge!\n\nSpread your wings and prepare for a high-speed airborne adventure in Feather Dodge! In this vibrant, fast-paced VR arcade experience, you control a swift little bird soaring through a dense, beautiful pine forest. Your mission is simple but intense: survive the incoming rush of eccentric, colorful birds flying straight your way!\n\nThe sky gets crowded quickly as a massive variety of round, stylized feathered rivals zoom past. Use your VR controllers to seamlessly weave left, right, up, and down to avoid sudden mid-air collisions. As the timer ticks up, the speed increases and the patterns become trickier, pushing your hand-eye coordination and spatial awareness to the absolute limit.\n\nHow long can you rule the forest canopy before the chaos catches up to you?\n\nKey Features:\nIntuitive VR Controls: Seamlessly guide your bird's flight path using your VR controllers for sharp, precise, and responsive dodging mechanics.\n\nFast-Paced Arcade Thrills: Experience a continuous wave of unpredictable incoming traffic that tests your reaction speed with every second.\n\nVibrant Stylized Visuals: Fly through a beautifully animated 3D forest environment filled with lush greenery, towering trees, and a colorful cast of expressive avian characters.\n\nDynamic High-Score Tracking: Watch your survival time climb in real-time, push past your limits, and try to break your personal record on every run.", "short_description": "Take flight and test your reflexes! Navigate a swift bird through a dense, endless forest, dodging incoming waves of colorful feathered rivals in this fast-paced VR arcade challenge."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Broken Engineers", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https:/